<title>RUSSIA: Russian Duma to get new tax code soon - Yeltsin.</title>
<headline>Russian Duma to get new tax code soon - Yeltsin.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian government has nearly finished drafting a new tax code which will be submitted to the State Duma lower house of parliament in the next few weeks, President Boris Yeltsin said on Thursday.</p>
